: arguments
: Test parse_attach_arguments() with various command lines
:
{{
  $* arguments '4242'         >'4242'       : plain
  $* arguments '  4242	'     >'4242'       : whitespace
  $* arguments '4294967295'   >'4294967295' : largest
  $* arguments '4294967296'   >'invalid'    : overflow
  $* arguments '0'            >'invalid'    : zero
  $* arguments ''             >'invalid'    : empty
  $* arguments '   '          >'invalid'    : blank
  $* arguments '+4242'        >'invalid'    : sign
  $* arguments '-1'           >'invalid'    : negative
  $* arguments '0x10'         >'invalid'    : hex
  $* arguments '42 42'        >'invalid'    : two
  $* arguments '4242x'        >'invalid'    : trailing
}}

: result
: Test the mapping of settled companion states to attach results
:
{{
  $* result active      >'active'      : active
  $* result unsupported >'unsupported' : unsupported
  $* result failed      >'failed'      : failed
}}
